You have an Azure subscription that contains the resources shown in the following table.

| Name                              | Description                                                   |
|-----------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------|
| VNet1                             | Virtual network that contains a subnet named Subnet1          |
| privatelink.vaultcore.azure.net   | Azure Private DNS zone                                        |
| Vault1                            | Azure key vault                                               |

You need to automate the creation of private endpoints for Vault1 by using an Azure Resource Manager (ARM) template.

How should you complete the template? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.

NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.

---

```
{
  "type": "Microsoft.Network/privateEndpoints",
  "apiVersion": "2024-05-01",
  "name": "Vault1-PE",
  "location": "southeastasia",
  "properties": {
    "privateLinkServiceConnections": [
      {
        "name": "Vault1-PE",
        "properties": {
          "privateLinkServiceId": "[resourceId('Microsoft.KeyVault/vaults', 'Vault1')]",
          "groupIds": [
            "vault"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "subnet": {
      "id": "[resourceId('Microsoft.Network/virtualNetworks/subnets', 'VNET1', 'Subnet1')]"
    }
  }
}
```
